          <rules>
            <rule name="Sergeant Armoury Restrictions" id="r8-um-loc-arm-veteran-sgt-arm-rule" hidden="false">
              <description>The Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted Space Marine Armoury equipment. Unit-specific options and equipment already carried are not repeated here. No item may be selected more than once unless specifically permitted. A Pair of Lightning Claws counts as two weapon choices.</description>
