      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Nemesis Destroyer | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
MORTIFIER BOLTER Mortifier bolter are normal Bolters that have the Poisoned (3+) and Pinning Special Rules
• 4 Nemesis Destroyers
• 1 Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Mortifier Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Counter-Attack
• Stubborn
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Nemesis Destroyers for +25 points per model.
• For every five models in the squad, one Nemesis Destroyer may replace his Mortifier Bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer .................................... +10 points
• Missile Launcher with Suspensor Web
and Rad Missiles ................................ +25 points
• One model may carry:
• Legion Vexilla .................................. +10 points
• One different model may carry:
• Nuncio Vox ...................................... +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +5 points per model
NEMESIS DESTROYER SERGEANT
The Sergeant may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon .................................... +5 points
• Power weapon ..................................... +10 points
• Power fist ....................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ................................... +20 points
The Sergeant may take:
• Artificer Armour ................................. +10 points
• Up to three Phosphex Bombs ...................... +10 points each
The Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r8-um-nem-dt-transport-rule" name="Dedicated Transport" hidden="false"><description>This squad may select the listed Dedicated Transport where Transport Capacity permits.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-rule-0" name="Mortifier Bolter" hidden="false"><description>Mortifier Bolters are normal Bolters with the Poisoned (3+) and Pinning special rules.

Pinning: Unsaved Wounds caused by this weapon force the unit to take a Pinning Test.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-rule-1" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Power Armour; Mortifier Bolter; Bolt pistol; Chainsword; Rad grenades.</description></rule></rules>
