      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Remus Ventanus" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Remus Ventanus | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
THE SAVIOUR OF CALTH Ventanus and any Ultramarines unit he has joined have Fearless while at least one model from the unit is within 6" of an objective. PRACTICAL COMMANDER After both armies have deployed but before the first turn begins, nominate one Legion Tactical Squad in the army. That squad gains Counter-Attack for the duration of the battle. COMMAND RETINUE Ventanus may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Power weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Nuncio Vox
• Frag grenades
• Legion Standart
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Independent Character
• The Saviour of Calth
• Practical Commander
OPTIONS
• Remus Ventanus may take:
• Krak grenades ................................... +2 points
• Melta bombs .................................... +5 points</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-rule-0" name="The Saviour of Calth" hidden="false"><description>Ventanus and any Ultramarines unit he has joined have Fearless while at least one model from the unit is within 6 inches of an objective.

Fearless: Automatically passes all Morale and Pinning tests. May not Take Cover! or choose to voluntarily fail a break test.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-rule-1" name="Practical Commander" hidden="false"><description>After both armies deploy but before the first turn, nominate one Legion Tactical Squad in the army. That squad gains Counter-Attack for the duration of the battle.

Counter-Attack: If this unit is not engaged with any enemy models and an enemy unit successfully completes a charge move against it, the unit may take a Leadership test. If passed, this unit gains +1 Attack during the Assault phase.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-5-remus-ventanus-rule-2" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Artificer Armour; Refractor Field; Power weapon; Bolt pistol; Nuncio Vox; Frag grenades; Legion Standard.</description></rule></rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
