      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiii-7-honoured-telemechrus-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Honoured Telemechrus | 6 | 5 | 7 | 13 | 12 | 10 | 4 | 4
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 1 Honoured Telemechrus
Unit Type:
• Vehicle (Walker)
Wargear:
• Kheres Assault Cannon
• Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon
with built-in Twin-linked Bolter
• Smoke Launchers
• Searchlight
Special Rules:
• Atomantic Shielding
• Fleet
• Hatred (Word Bearers)
RESTRICTION
Honoured Telemechrus is Loyalist only.

Twin-Linked: Re-roll failed To Hit rolls with this weapon. Does not count as two weapons. Twin-linked Template weapons automatically hit all models fully or partially under the Template.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-7-honoured-telemechrus-rule-0" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Kheres Assault Cannon; Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon with built-in Twin-linked Bolter; Smoke Launchers; Searchlight.

Twin-Linked: Re-roll failed To Hit rolls with this weapon. Does not count as two weapons. Twin-linked Template weapons automatically hit all models fully or partially under the Template.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-7-honoured-telemechrus-rule-1" name="Loyalist Only" hidden="false"><description>Honoured Telemechrus may only be selected in a Loyalist Ultramarines army.</description></rule></rules>
    </selectionEntry>
