      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Titus Prayto | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
PSYCHIC POWERS Titus Prayto selects two psychic powers from the normal Psychic Power list. He follows all normal ProHammer rules for Psykers, Mastery Level 2 and Disturbance in the Warp. PSYCHIC SAVANT Once during each Ultramarines player turn, Prayto may re-roll one failed Psychic Test. The second result must be accepted. COMMAND RETINUE Prayto may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Force Weapon
• Psychic Hood
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Independent Character
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Legion Support Officer
• Psychic Savant
OPTIONS
• Titus Prayto may take:
• Krak grenades ................................... +2 points</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-rule-0" name="Psychic Powers" hidden="false"><description>Titus Prayto selects two psychic powers from the normal Psychic Power list and follows the normal ProHammer rules for Psykers, Mastery Level 2 and Disturbance in the Warp.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-rule-1" name="Psychic Savant" hidden="false"><description>Once during each Ultramarines player turn, Prayto may re-roll one failed Psychic Test. The second result must be accepted.</description></rule><rule id="r8-r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-rule-2" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Artificer Armour; Refractor Field; Force Weapon; Psychic Hood; Bolt pistol; Frag grenades.</description></rule></rules>
