                      </constraints>
                      <rules>
                        <rule name="Endurance" id="r7-prayto-r29-lib-power-5-rule" hidden="false">
                          <description>Blessing — friendly unit within 24”. The unit gains Eternal Warrior, Feel No Pain (5+) and Relentless.

Relentless: Model may move and fire Heavy, Ordnance, Salvo or Rapid Fire weapons as if it remained stationary. It may still charge even after firing such weapons.
Eternal Warrior: Immune to Instant Death / Massive Wounds. The model suffers 1 Wound instead of D3 Wounds.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                      <modifiers>
                        </modifiers>
                      <categoryLinks>
                        <categoryLink id="r7-prayto-r80-ih-consul-cat-48" name="Head of the Gorgon — non-Forge-Lord Consul" hidden="false" targetId="r80-ih-head-nonforge-consul" primary="false" />
